# The trash-expire module's own texts: its name and the line under it.
brain-task-trash-expire = Empty the trash
brain-task-trash-expire-does = Permanently deletes what has been in the trash for four days or more. The four days count from when you threw it away, not from when the file was made: something made years ago and thrown away this morning still has four days. Four days is long enough to notice a mistake, and short enough that the trash does not become a second disk. It is the only task here whose work cannot be undone.
brain-task-trash-expire-brief = Deletes for good what has been in the trash for four days or more.
